{
  "id": "4504fc4d-5bb2-4ffa-85f5-4a7ad991bd58",
  "version": "1.9",
  "name": "VendorClearance",
  "runtime": "maestro",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "noteTitle",
      "type": "stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": "1.0",
      "display": {
        "label": "stickyNote"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "color": "gray",
        "content": "VENDORGATE - Vendor Onboarding & Risk Clearance\nStraight-through registration is solved. This flow starts where the old automation gave up: the packet that does not validate cleanly."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "noteIntake",
      "type": "stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": "1.0",
      "display": {
        "label": "stickyNote"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "color": "blue",
        "content": "1 - EVENT-DRIVEN INTAKE & GENERATIVE EXTRACTION\nA portal submission writes the packet to Data Fabric; a Record Created trigger starts the flow. It claims the newest submission, fetches the documents, and the extraction agent turns raw text into typed documents."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "noteValidation",
      "type": "stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": "1.0",
      "display": {
        "label": "stickyNote"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "color": "yellow",
        "content": "2 - CROSS-DOCUMENT VALIDATION\nAgent checks name consistency, expiries, bank holder vs licensed entity."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "noteQueryLoop",
      "type": "stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": "1.0",
      "display": {
        "label": "stickyNote"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "color": "orange",
        "content": "3 - VENDOR QUERY LOOP (the main event)\nIssues go to the vendor with a 48h deadline. Resubmission re-fetches and re-extracts the corrected documents; timeout escalates to procurement. Nothing fails silently."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "noteScreening",
      "type": "stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": "1.0",
      "display": {
        "label": "stickyNote"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "color": "red",
        "content": "4 - SCREENING & RISK\nAgent calls live tools: OFAC-seeded Data Fabric register + adverse-media web search. Deterministic risk score in code; sanctions can never route below high."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "noteApprovals",
      "type": "stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": "1.0",
      "display": {
        "label": "stickyNote"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "color": "purple",
        "content": "5 - RISK-TIERED APPROVALS\nLow auto-clears. Medium: single approver. High: parallel Legal + Security, both must return. Rejection is persisted."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "noteProvisioning",
      "type": "stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": "1.0",
      "display": {
        "label": "stickyNote"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "color": "green",
        "content": "6 - PROVISIONING + COMPENSATION\nVendor master written, portal API called. Failure rolls the record back to Failed - executed live, not just drawn."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "extractDocs",
      "type": "uipath.agent.autonomous",
      "typeVersion": "1.3",
      "display": {
        "label": "Extraction Agent (generative)",
        "subLabel": "",
        "icon": "autonomous-agent"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "source": "b6c3011d-9185-40a0-9ffb-fd4cae5a1759",
        "agentInputVariables": [
          {
            "id": "buildPacket__output__packetText",
            "type": "string",
            "binding": "=$vars.buildPacket.output.packetText",
            "description": "Bound from $vars.buildPacket.output.packetText"
          },
          {
            "id": "buildPacket__output__docsJson",
            "type": "string",
            "binding": "=$vars.buildPacket.output.docsJson",
            "description": "Bound from $vars.buildPacket.output.docsJson"
          }
        ],
        "agentOutputVariables": [
          {
            "id": "docsJson",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "id": "count",
            "type": "number"
          },
          {
            "id": "mode",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "id": "extractionNotes",
            "type": "string"
          }
        ]
      },
      "outputs": {
        "output": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "The return value of the script",
          "source": "=result.response",
          "var": "output"
        },
        "error": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Error information if the script fails",
          "source": "=Error",
          "var": "error"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "validationAgent",
      "type": "uipath.agent.autonomous",
      "typeVersion": "1.3",
      "display": {
        "label": "Validation Agent",
        "icon": "autonomous-agent"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "source": "5de57b82-0cb8-4141-b99b-c2ab9b2df49a",
        "agentInputVariables": [
          {
            "id": "extractDocs__output__docsJson",
            "type": "string",
            "binding": "=$vars.extractDocs.output.docsJson",
            "description": "Bound from $vars.extractDocs.output.docsJson"
          },
          {
            "id": "pickVendor__output__country",
            "type": "string",
            "binding": "=$vars.pickVendor.output.country",
            "description": "Bound from $vars.pickVendor.output.country"
          },
          {
            "id": "pickVendor__output__legalName",
            "type": "string",
            "binding": "=$vars.pickVendor.output.legalName",
            "description": "Bound from $vars.pickVendor.output.legalName"
          }
        ],
        "agentOutputVariables": [
          {
            "id": "passed",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          {
            "id": "issues",
            "type": "array"
          },
          {
            "id": "nameVariants",
            "type": "array"
          },
          {
            "id": "expiringWithin30Days",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          {
            "id": "confidence",
            "type": "number"
          }
        ]
      },
      "outputs": {
        "output": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Agent response",
          "source": "=result.response",
          "var": "output"
        },
        "error": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Error information if the node fails",
          "source": "=Error",
          "var": "error"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "checkIssues",
      "type": "core.logic.decision",
      "typeVersion": "1.2",
      "display": {
        "label": "Blocking Issues Found",
        "icon": "trending-up-down"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "expression": "$vars.validationAgent.output.passed === false",
        "trueLabel": "Issues found",
        "falseLabel": "Clean"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "vendorQuery",
      "type": "uipath.human-in-the-loop.quick-form",
      "typeVersion": "1.0",
      "display": {
        "label": "Vendor Query - Fix and Resubmit",
        "icon": "users"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "title": "Vendor query: issues found in your registration packet",
        "priority": "High",
        "schema": {
          "schemaId": "7f3b1a20-91c4-4a52-9d7e-2b64c1a90a11",
          "fields": [
            {
              "id": "vendorref",
              "label": "Vendor reference",
              "type": "text",
              "direction": "input",
              "binding": "vars.pickVendor.output.vendorId"
            },
            {
              "id": "legalname",
              "label": "Legal entity name",
              "type": "text",
              "direction": "input",
              "binding": "vars.pickVendor.output.legalName"
            },
            {
              "id": "issuesummary",
              "label": "Blocking issues found",
              "type": "text",
              "direction": "input",
              "binding": "vars.validationAgent.output.issues"
            }
          ],
          "outcomes": [
            {
              "id": "resubmitted",
              "name": "Resubmitted",
              "type": "string",
              "isPrimary": true,
              "action": "Continue"
            }
          ]
        },
        "recipient": {
          "channels": [
            "Email",
            "ActionCenter"
          ],
          "connections": {},
          "assignee": {
            "type": "group"
          }
        }
      },
      "outputs": {
        "output": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Task result data",
          "descriptionKey": "hitlOutputBuilder_taskResultData_description",
          "source": "=result",
          "var": "output",
          "properties": {
            "Action": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "Resubmitted"
              ],
              "default": "Resubmitted"
            }
          }
        },
        "status": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Task completion status",
          "descriptionKey": "hitlOutputBuilder_taskCompletionStatus_description",
          "source": "=result.Action",
          "var": "status",
          "enum": [
            "Resubmitted"
          ],
          "default": "Resubmitted"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "delay48h",
      "type": "core.logic.delay",
      "typeVersion": "1.0",
      "display": {
        "label": "48h Query Window",
        "icon": "timer"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "timerType": "timeDuration",
        "timerPreset": "custom",
        "timerValue": "P2D"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "checkDeadline",
      "type": "core.logic.decision",
      "typeVersion": "1.2",
      "display": {
        "label": "Still Unresolved After 48h",
        "icon": "trending-up-down"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "expression": "!($vars.vendorQuery && $vars.vendorQuery.status === 'Resubmitted')",
        "trueLabel": "Timed out",
        "falseLabel": "Resolved"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "escalateTimeout",
      "type": "uipath.human-in-the-loop.quick-form",
      "typeVersion": "1.0",
      "display": {
        "label": "Escalate to Procurement Officer",
        "icon": "users"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "title": "Vendor did not respond within 48h",
        "priority": "High",
        "schema": {
          "schemaId": "3e9a5c72-6d18-4b0f-8a41-c95d2e77b3a2",
          "fields": [
            {
              "id": "vendorref",
              "label": "Vendor reference",
              "type": "text",
              "direction": "input",
              "binding": "vars.pickVendor.output.vendorId"
            },
            {
              "id": "legalname",
              "label": "Legal entity name",
              "type": "text",
              "direction": "input",
              "binding": "vars.pickVendor.output.legalName"
            },
            {
              "id": "openissues",
              "label": "Open issues (unanswered 48h)",
              "type": "text",
              "direction": "input",
              "binding": "vars.validationAgent.output.issues"
            }
          ],
          "outcomes": [
            {
              "id": "acknowledged",
              "name": "Acknowledged",
              "type": "string",
              "isPrimary": true,
              "action": "Continue"
            }
          ]
        },
        "recipient": {
          "channels": [
            "Email",
            "ActionCenter"
          ],
          "connections": {},
          "assignee": {
            "type": "group"
          }
        }
      },
      "outputs": {
        "output": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Task result data",
          "source": "=result",
          "var": "output",
          "properties": {
            "Action": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "Acknowledged"
              ],
              "default": "Acknowledged"
            }
          }
        },
        "status": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Task completion status",
          "source": "=result.Action",
          "var": "status",
          "enum": [
            "Acknowledged"
          ],
          "default": "Acknowledged"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "screeningAgent",
      "type": "uipath.agent.autonomous",
      "typeVersion": "1.3",
      "display": {
        "label": "Screening Agent",
        "icon": "autonomous-agent"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "source": "47e795d6-ca08-4c0d-b1a9-47071a08b775",
        "agentInputVariables": [
          {
            "id": "pickVendor__output__legalName",
            "type": "string",
            "binding": "=$vars.pickVendor.output.legalName",
            "description": "Bound from $vars.pickVendor.output.legalName"
          },
          {
            "id": "pickVendor__output__country",
            "type": "string",
            "binding": "=$vars.pickVendor.output.country",
            "description": "Bound from $vars.pickVendor.output.country"
          },
          {
            "id": "validationAgent__output__nameVariants",
            "type": "array",
            "binding": "=$vars.validationAgent.output.nameVariants",
            "description": "Bound from $vars.validationAgent.output.nameVariants"
          }
        ],
        "agentOutputVariables": [
          {
            "id": "sanctionsHit",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          {
            "id": "debarmentHit",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          {
            "id": "adverseMedia",
            "type": "array"
          },
          {
            "id": "recommendedTier",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "id": "rationale",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "id": "confidence",
            "type": "number"
          }
        ]
      },
      "outputs": {
        "output": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Agent response",
          "source": "=result.response",
          "var": "output"
        },
        "error": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Error information if the node fails",
          "source": "=Error",
          "var": "error"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "toolScreeningList",
      "type": "uipath.agent.resource.tool.connector.uipath-uipath-dataservice.query-entity-records",
      "typeVersion": "1.0.0",
      "display": {
        "label": "Sanctions & Debarment Lookup (Data Fabric)",
        "subLabel": "",
        "icon": "https://cloud.uipath.com/686f994e-6d37-46c3-916d-770e0bc23c28/studio_/typecache/icons/98381fa079bbcf73264f551006d6ef7580fb53992f3d9f94361eb5d9e06040cb.svg"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "source": "7c1a9e42-3d5f-4b8a-9e2c-6f0d8b3a5c71",
        "detail": {
          "connector": "uipath-uipath-dataservice",
          "connectionId": "127fb909-ac85-4c93-938f-135ab0398a6c",
          "connectionResourceId": "127fb909-ac85-4c93-938f-135ab0398a6c",
          "connectionFolderKey": "cd671762-f695-48f8-ac4b-f849efe70464",
          "method": "POST",
          "endpoint": "/v2/{entityName}/qer",
          "pathParameters": {
            "entityName": "Vendor"
          },
          "queryParameters": {
            "limit": 100,
            "expansionLevel": 3,
            "isAscending": false,
            "start": 0
          },
          "bodyParameters": {
            "_sortFieldName": "{{prompt: \"Specify the field to sort the results by\"}}"
          },
          "objectName": "QueryEntityRecordsCurated",
          "configuration": "=jsonString:{\"essentialConfiguration\":{\"connectorVersion\":\"1.70.0\",\"customFieldsRequestDetails\":{\"objectActionName\":\"GenerateSchema\",\"parameterValues\":[[\"entityName\",\"Vendor\"]]},\"instanceParameters\":{\"connectorKey\":\"uipath-uipath-dataservice\",\"objectName\":\"QueryEntityRecordsCurated\",\"httpMethod\":\"POST\",\"activityType\":\"Curated\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"supportsStreaming\":false,\"subType\":\"standard\"},\"objectName\":\"QueryEntityRecordsCurated\",\"operation\":\"list\",\"packageVersion\":\"1.0.0\",\"httpMethod\":\"POST\",\"path\":\"/v2/{entityName}/qer\",\"unifiedTypesCompatible\":true},\"optionalConfiguration\":{\"_textBlocks\":[{\"name\":\"schemaAPIErrorMessage\",\"text\":\"Could not generate schema for the chosen entity.\",\"severity\":\"error\"}],\"objectActions\":[{\"actionType\":\"api\",\"rules\":[{\"type\":\"path\",\"refFieldName\":\"entityName\",\"refFieldValues\":[\"*\"],\"isCleared\":false,\"isVariable\":false}],\"name\":\"GenerateSchema\",\"apiConfiguration\":{\"url\":\"/standard-objects/{entityName}/qer/metadata\",\"method\":\"GET\"},\"onSuccess\":{\"type\":\"remap\",\"remapConfiguration\":{\"input\":\"replace\",\"output\":\"replace\"}},\"onFailure\":{\"type\":\"remap\",\"remapConfiguration\":{\"input\":\"noop\",\"output\":\"noop\"},\"actions\":[{\"actionType\":\"showMessages\",\"refFieldName\":\"entityName\",\"messages\":[\"schemaAPIErrorMessage\"]}]}},{\"actionType\":\"reset\",\"rules\":[{\"type\":\"path\",\"refFieldName\":\"entityName\",\"isCleared\":true,\"isVariable\":false}],\"name\":\"ClearContent\"}],\"connectorName\":\"UiPath Data Fabric\",\"maxPageSize\":null,\"jobArguments\":null,\"isAutopilotInvalidConfig\":false,\"additionalHeaders\":null,\"cachedLookupValues\":[[\"entityName\",[{\"id\":\"Vendor\",\"displayColumns\":[\"Vendor\"],\"stringFormatDisplayColumns\":\"\"}]]],\"cachedBrowserItems\":[],\"cachedPropertyMappings\":[],\"primaryKeys\":[],\"objectDisplayName\":\"Query Entity R